<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebru</book>
  <para style="h">Hebru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebru</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebru</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlanlaiah Pathian in kan pupa pawl hnenah voi tampi a phunphun in profet pawl hmangin thu a rak sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi ni neta bik lamah cun kan hnenah a Fapa sungin a sim a si. Cuih a Fapa hmangin Pathian in lei le van a sersiam ih a netnak ah ziang hmuahhmuah nei ṭhehtu si dingin Amah cu a hrilmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu Pathian sunlawinak langtertu a si ih Pathian sinak famkim a nei. Huham a neimi a thu in leikhawvel le vantlolak pumpi cu a cawmdawl ih a fingkhawi. Minung pawl ih sual ngaidamnak le sual thianternak a tuah ṭheh hnuah vancungah Cungnungbik Pathian ih vorhlamah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in a Fapa hnenih a pekmi hmin cu vanmi pawl ih hmin hnakin a cungnung sawn bangtuk in a Fapa cu vanmi pawl hnakih cungnung sawn in a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian in ziangbangtuk vancungmi hman: “Nangmah cu ka Fapa na si; tuihsun ah na Pa ah ka cang zo,” a ti dah lo. Cuih tlunah ziangbangtuk vancungmi thu khalah, “Keimah cu a Pa ka si ding ih, amah cu ka Fa a si ding,” a ti dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in a fatir leilungih a run thlah tikah, “Pathian ih vancungmi hmuahhmuah in amah cu an biak ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla vancungmi pawl thu ahcun, “Pathian in a vancungmi pawl cu thli ah a tuah ih, A hnaṭuantu pawl cu mei-alh ah a tuah a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule a Fapa thu ah Pathian in, “Nangmah cu Pathian na si ih, na bawi tokham cu kumkhua in a hmun ding; Na minung pawl dingnak in na uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dingnak na duh ih sualnak na hua. Curuangah a si Pathian, Na Pathian in a lo hril ih, Na rualpi pawl hnenih a pekmi hnakin a tum cuangmi upat lungawinak a lo pek,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Cule Bawipa nangmah in a hramthokah leilung cu na seemsuah ih, Na kut rori in van tla khi na sersiam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cu pawl cu an hloral ding, sikhalsehla nang cu na hmun ding. Annih cu puan bangin an ṭet ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Angki bangin na bil ding ih hnipuan bangin an thleng aw ṭheh ding a si. Sikhalsehla nang cu nangmah keel na si ringring ih na nunnak cu cem ti a nei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in a vanmi hnenah, “Na ral pawl cu na kephah ih ka ret hlan lo, ka vorhlamah to aw,” a ti dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuti asile vancungmi pawl cu zo so an si? Annih cu Pathian a riantu thlarau an si ih rundamnak a ngahtu ding pawl bawm dingah Pathian ih thlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah zinpeng zawh ih kan pial lonak dingah kan theih ciami thudik cu hnget sinsin ih kan pom a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vancungmi in kan pupa pawl hnenih an pekmi thu kha a dikmi a si tiin langter a si ih cuih thu a ngai lo le a thlun lotu cu hrem tlak an si vekin hremnak an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuti asile kannih in hi tlukih rundamnak maksak hi zianghman ih kan siar lo a si ahcun ziangtinso hremnak ihsin kan luat thei ding? Bawipa amah rori in hi rundamnak thu cu a hmaisabik ah a than ih amah a theitu hmuahhmuah in a dik zia kha kan hnenah an langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule annih ih an theihpinak a dik a si ti theihnak ah Pathian in khawruahhar le hmuhsaknak mak a phunphun a tuah ih Amah ih duhnak bangtuk in Thlarau Thianghlim ih laksawng kha a zem ciar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in a ra thleng dingmi a thu kan relmi lei thar uktu dingah vancungmi a ret dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cu hnakin, Ca Thianghlim in hmun khat khatah, “Maw Pathian, milai hi ziangso a si ih na seherh ringring? Mihring taak ko hi ziangso a si ih a zawn na ruah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vancungmi hnakih niam deuh ah caan tawite sung na tuah; Sunlawinak le upatnak lukhuh na khumter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuah uktu-ah na tuah,” a ti. Pathian in minung cu, “Ziang hmuahhmuah uktu-ah a tuah,” a ti. Ziang hmuahhmuah timi sungah hin ziang tinkim a tel a si. Sikhalsehla atu-ah cun minung hi ziang hmuahhmuah uktu a si ti kan hmu hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain Jesuh cu, Pathian zaangfahnak ruangah mi hmuahhmuah ai-ih a thihnak ding hrangah, amah cu caan tawite sung vancungmi hnakin niam deuhah tuah a si ti kan hmu. Cule cutiih thihnak a tuar ruangah atu-ah cun sunlawinak le upatnak lukhuh khumin kan hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minung tampi in Pathian sunlawinak an co thei venak dingah ziangzongza a tuahtu le a nungtertu Pathian in harsat tuarnak sungin Jesuh kha mi famkimih a tuah cu a dikmi a si. Ziangahtile Jesuh cu rundamnak ah anmah a hruai haitu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah in minung pawl cu an sualnak in a tlengfai ih Amah le a tlenfaimi hmuahhmuah in Pa pakhat an nei tlaang a si. Cuti a si ruangah Jesuh in annih pawl cu ‘Ka unau,’ tiih kawh dingah a ning a zak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah in Pathian hnenah, “Na tuahmi cu ka unau pawl hnenah ka sim ding; An pumkhawmnak ah ka lo thangṭhat ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih tlunah, “Pathian cu kan rinsan ding,” a ti ih, “hittawk ah Pathian ih i pekmi nauhak pawl hnenah ka um,” tiah a ti fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiin “Nauhak pawl,” tiih a kawhmi a minung pawl cu thi le sa a neimi minung an si ruangah Jesuh khal cu anmah bangtuk in thi le sa nei-ah a cang ih milai sinak thawn a nung ve. Hitiin a tuah tikah a tumtahmi cu amah a thihnak ihsin thihnak parih thu neitu Satan kha a siatsuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />cuticun an nun sung hmuahhmuah thih ṭih-ah sal bangin khua a sami pawl luatter dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangahtile a bommi pawl cu vancungmi an si lo, ti a fiang. Ca Thianghlim in a sim vekin, “Abraham tesinfa pawl a bawm,” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah ziangtinkim ah a unau pawl vek a si ve a ṭul ih cuti a sinak cu minung pawl in sual ngaidamnak an co theinak dingah Pathian hna a ṭuannak ah hin rinsantlak le zaangfahnak neitu Puithiam Saang a si theinak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah rori in sualforhnak le harsatnak a tuar zo ruangah atu-ah sualforhnak a tongmi pawl a bawm thei a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ih kawh vemi Khristian unau pawl, kan zumnak hrangih Puithiam Saang si dingah Pathian ih a run thlahmi Jesuh thu hi ruathnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses cu Pathian inn sung hnaṭuan ah rintlak a si bangtuk in Jesuh khal hi hnaṭuantu si dingah a hriltu Pathian hnenah rinsan tlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn saktu in a sakmi inn hnakin upatnak tam sawn a ngah. Cubangtuk in Jesuh khal Moses hnakin upatnak tam sawn ngah tlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inn hmuahhmuah cu mi pakhatkhatih sakmi a si; asinain ziang hmuahhmuah a saktu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses cu Pathian hnaṭuantu a si bangin Pathian innsang sungah rintlak hnaṭuantu a si ih Pathian in hmailam caanih a sim leh dingmi khal a sim thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cu Pathian innsang ah hotu rinsan tlak Pathian Fapa a si. Kanmah hi kan ruahsanmi kha thinlung hngetkhoh le ralṭha zetin kan kaihnget a si ahcun a innsang kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Thlarau Thianghlim in, “Tuihsun Pathian aw nan thei asile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi lungruh va si hlah uh. Nan pupa pawl Pathian dodal ih an rak si vek cun si hlah uh; Hramlakih Pathian an hniksak Ni ih an rak um vek cun um ve hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in, ‘Kha tawkah nan pupa pawl in in dodal ih in hniksak a si; Kum sawmli sung an hrangih ka tuahmi an hmu naón,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah an parah ka thin a heng ih, ‘Annih cu rintlak lo an si ringring; Ka thupekmi an thlun duh lo,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin a heng ih, ‘An colhnak ding hrangah ka timi ram cu an thleng hrimhrim lo ding, tiah thu ka tiam,’ a rak ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zumtu u le nau pawl, a nungmi Pathian tlansan duh khop tiangih a ṭha lomi le, zum lonak thinlung nan neih lonak dingah ralring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuhnakin sualnak ih bummi nan si lonak dingah le mi lungruh nan si lonak dingah Ca Thianghlim in “Tuihsun,” a timi ṭongfang hi kan hrangah sullam neimi a si sung ahcun, nitinte pakhat le pakhat bawm aw sawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangahtile a hramthok ihsin kan rak comi thinlung hnangamnak kha a netnak tiang kan kaihnget thei a si ahcun kan zatein Khrih ih hawipi kan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ca Thianghlim in, “Tuih sunah, Pathian aw nan theih asile, Nan pupa pawl in Pathian an rak dodal vek cun nan lung ruhter hlah uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zoso Pathian aw a thei ih a dotu cu an si? Izipt ram ihsin Moses ih a hruaisuakmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zo parah so Pathian kha kum sawmli sung a thin a heng? Nelrawn ramṭhing lakah a sual ih a thimi pawl parah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in thu kam-aw in, “An colhnak dingah ka timi ram cu an thleng hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti tikah a ti duh sanmi zo so an si? Amah Pathian a dodaltu kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutiin asile a kammi ram sungih an luh thei lonak cu an zum lo ruangah a si, ti kan hmu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih colhnak cu ngah thei dingah Pathian in thukamnak in pe zo. Cutiih in kammi colhnak sungah thleng thei loin kan um pang lonak dingah ralring zetin um uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangahtile anmah ih an rak theih vekin kannih khal in Thuthang ṭha cu kan thei zo. Sikhalsehla Thuthang an theihmi cu an hrangah ṭhathnemnak zianghman a um lo, ziangahtile a theih lawng an thei ih zumnak thawn an pom duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain kannih a zumtu pawl hi Pathian ih a kammi colhnak a cotu sawn kan si. Pathian in, “Ka thin a heng ih, ‘An colhnak dingah ka timi ram cu an thleng hrimhrim dah lo ding,’ tiah thu ka kam,” a timi cu a kim a si. Leilung a rak tuah ihsin a hnaṭuan cu a ṭheh thluh naón hi bangtuk in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim in hmunkhat khatah ni sarih ni thu ah, “Ni sarih ni ah Pathian cu a hnaṭuannak ihsin a cawl,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himi thu ahhin a sim hrihmi a um, “An colhnak dingah ka timi ram cu an thleng hrimhrim dah lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuthang ṭha a thei hmaisatu pawl in cuih colhnak an ngah lo, ziangahtile Bawipa ih thu an thlun lo. Asinain a co ngahtu ding midang an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himi cu Pathian in “Tuihsun,” timi ni dang pakhat a retsalnak in a fiangter a si. Kum tampi hnuah a tlunih kan sim ciami Ca Thianghlim sungih a um vekin Pathian in David sungin, “Tuihsun Pathian aw nan theih asile mi lungruh va si hlah uh,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ih kam ciami colhnak kha mipi hnenah Joshua in rak pe ngah sehla “Tuihsun,” timi ni dangih thu kha Pathian in a sim nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu vek a si ahcun Pathian cu ni sarih ni ih a colh vekin Pathian minung pawl hrangah colhnak ding a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian ih kammi colhnak ngahtu cu, Pathian a hnaṭuannak in a colh vekin, an hnaṭuannak in an cawl ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian ih tiammi colhnak kan co theinak dingah kan zuam thei patawp in zuam uhsi. Annih pawl in Bawipa ih thu an thlun lo ruangah an co thei lo vek cun kannih pawl pakhat hman si hram hlah uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ih thu cu a nungih a cak fawn. Kap hnih hriam ralnam hnakin a hriam sawn. Nunnak le thlarau an ton awknak le hlikhlok le thlik an peh awknak tiang a suntlang thei a si. Milai thinlung ih duhnak le ruahnak tla a thei thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian hmaika ah zianghman kan thuh theimi a um lo. Pathian ih sersiammi thil hmuahhmuah cu a hmaika ah on thluhmi le pharh thluhmi bangtuk in an lang. Ni khatkhat cu amah ih hnenah thuhla kan neihmi hmuahhmuah kan phuang thluh leh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah kan zumnak hi khoh zetin kaihnget uh si. Ziangahtile Pathian Fapa Jesuh cu kan Puithiam Saang maktak a si ih amah cu Pathian umnak rori ah a thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan Puithiam Saang cu kan ṭonṭaihnak in theihsak lotu a si lo. Kanmah vekin sualforhnak a phunphun a tong vemi a si; asinain anih cu a sual lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah Pathian bawi tokham cu ralṭha zetin pan uhsi; cutawkah zaangfahnak a um. Cutawkah ngilneihnak kan co ding ih kan ṭul tik caanah zaangfahnak kan ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam Sang pohpoh cu mipi lak ihsin hrilmi a si ih misenpi ai-awhtu ah Pathian hnaṭuantu dingih retmi a si. A hnaṭuan cu thawinak tuah le sualthlah thawinak pek tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah khal kim lonak a phunphun a neimi a si ruangah zianghman theihnak nei lo le a palhmi pawl parah lungnemnak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutiin tlaksamnak a neih ve ruangah cun midang sualnak hrang lawngah si loin amah ih sualnak hrang khalah raithawinak a pek a ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zokhal anmah le anmah Puithiam Sangah hril aw in an khaisaang aw thei lo. Aaron cu Pathian in a ko ih Puithiam Sang ih a can vekin zokhal Pathian kawhnak lawngin Puithiam Sangah an cang thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Khrih khal in amah le amah Puithiam saangah a khaisaang aw lo. Pathian sawn in, “Nangmah cu ka Fapa na si, tuihsun ah na Pa ah ka cang zo,” tiah a hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule hmun dangah, “Nang cu kumkhua in Puithiam na si ding; Melkhizedek puithiam si daan in na si ding,” tiah a ti lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilung tlunih a um laiah khan Jesuh in thihnak ihsin amah a runsuak theitu Pathian hnenah ringzet in a au ih mitthli tla-in thla a cam. Mi lungnem le pum pe-awmi a si ruangah Pathian in a theih sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ih Fapa a si ko naón Pathian ih thungaitu si dingah harsat tuarnak ihsin a zir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule mi famkimih tuah a si tikah a thu a ngaitu hmuahhmuah hrangah amah cu kumkhua rundamnak hramah a cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />cule Pathian in, “Melkhizedek ih puithiam si daan thlun in Puithiam Saang na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thu ahhin sim ding tampi ka nei; sikhalsehla thu nan theihthiam har tuk ruangah nan hnenih fiangter a harzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tucun zirhtu si ding hman nan cu zo; asinain Pathian thu a hramthok ihsin zirh nan ṭul lai. Rawl ngai ei nan cu naón cawhnawi nan in lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cawhnawi a intu cu nauhak a si lai; a ṭha le a sia theih theinak a nei hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla rawl ngai cu upa hrangah a si; annih cu thleidan thiamnak thinlung hmangin a ṭha le a sia an theithiam a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah hmailamah nor uhsi; Khristian thuthang a hramthokih zirh awknak cu tanta in pitling zirh awknak ah feh uhsi. Ṭhathnemnak zianghman a nei lomi hnaṭuannak kan tlansan zomi cu a hram ihsin thok nawn hlah uhsi; Pathian kan zumnak khal a hram ihsin nolh sal hlah uhsi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />baptisma thu le kutsuannak thu pawl, mithi thawhsalnak thu le kumkhua ih thuṭhennak thu pawl tla a hram ihsin thok sal rero hlah uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmailam sawnah nor uhsi. Pathian lungkimnak asile cumi sawn a si kan tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zumnak a tlansantu pawl cu ziangtinso sualsir awknak ah an kir thei sal nawn ding? Annih cu Pathian tleunak sungih a um dahmi an rak si; vancung laksawng a teptu an si ih Thlarau Thianghlim a cotu khal an rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ṭongkam a thawt zia a thei ngahtu an si ih a ra thleng dingmi sanih cahnak huham khal a teptu le a thei ngahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucingin an zumnak cu an tlansan! Cumi pawl sualsir awknak ih kirter sal ding cu a cang thei hrimhrim lomi a si; ziangahtile Pathian Fapa kha thinglamtah parah an khenbet sal ih misenpi hmaiah ningzak mualpho in an tuah sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruahti a rak hawptu leilung le lo a thlotu pawl hrangih a ṭhahnemmi rawl kung pawl a khotertu leilung cu Pathian ih thluasuahmi leilung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hling le hrampi lawnglawng a khotertu leilung cu ṭhathnemnak zianghman a nei lo; Pathian camsiatnak a tong thei ih meisa in ur ṭhehmi a si leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka duhdawtmi unau pawl, hi bangtuk in kan sim naón nannih thuhla ahcun lunghmuinak kan nei. Nannih cu thlawsuahnak a ṭha deuhmi rundamnak nan nei, ti kha kan thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in mi a thleidang lo. Nan hnaṭuanmi siseh, Pathian nan duhdawtnak langter tahratin nan Khristian rualpi pawl nan rak bomnak le atu khalah nan bom reronak pawl hi siseh, Pathian in a ciing ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan beiseimi cu a kim suak theinak dingah a net tiangin taimak suah fingfing uh, tihi kan saduhthah tum bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zaangzel nan si ding cu kan duh lo; sikhalsehla Pathian ih in kam ciami a cotu si dingah zumnak a neitu le thinsaunak neitu pawl bangtuk ih cang dingah kan lo duhsak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in amah hnakih a tum sawn hmin saal ding dang a um lo ruangah amah le mah hmin saal-aw in Abraham hnenah thutiamnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na hnenah thu ka lo tiam: thlawsuahnak ka lo pe ding ih tefa tampi na nei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abraham cu a thin a sau ruangah Pathian ih a tiammi a co ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in siat a serh tikah amah hnakih a tummi ih hmin saal in a tuah ahcun thu el awknak a um thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian cu a tumtahmi a ṭhin dah lo; cuih thu cu a thutiammi a cotu ding pawl hnenah fiangteih langter a duh ruangah a thutiammi tlunah amah ih hmin saal in thukamnak siatcam in a bet hrih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi thu pahnih hi thleng theih lomi an si ih Pathian khal in hi thu parah thuphan a per lo. Cuti a si ruangah amah thawn humhimnak a ngahtu kannih pawl hi tamzet ralṭhatnak le thathawhnak kan nei ih kan hmaiih ret ciami beiseinak cu khoh zetin kan pomhnget a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi beiseinak hi kan nunnak hrangah lawng colhternak thirkawn bangtuk a si. Kan hrangah himnak le hnangamnak a si ruangah vancung biakinn puanzar kha lan tahratin a sungih hmun thianghlim bikah a thleng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesuh cu cuih hmunah kanmah ih ai-awh in a rak thleng zo ih Melkhizedek puithiam a si daan in kumkhua Puithiam Saang a cang zo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Melkhizedek cu Salem khua siangpahrang a si ih Cungnungbik Pathian ih puithiam a si. Abraham cu ral a do ih siangpahrang pali a nehnak hmun ihsin a ra kir tikah Melkhizedek in a rak hmuak ih thlawsuah a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Abraham in ral hnenih a lonmi thil ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat cu Melkhizedek a pek. (Melkhizedek hminih tican pakhatnak cu “Dingnak Siangpahrang,” ti a si; cule amah cu Salem khua siangpahrang a si ruangah a hminih tican cu “Daihnak Siangpahrang,” ti khal a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Melkhizedek ih nu le pa thu le pi le pu ih thu nganmi zianghman a um lo. Amah ih suahnak siseh, a thihnak thu khal siseh, nganmi zianghman a um lo. Pathian Fapa bangtuk a si; curuangah kumkhua in puithiam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah ziangtlukin mi tum a si, ti cu nan thei. Mi hminthang le kan phun cithlahtu Abraham in ral hnenih a lonmi thil hmuahhmuah ih ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Levi miphun ih tesinfa puithiam a ṭuantu pawl cu Israel mipi hnen ihsin ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat lak dingin an Daan in a ti. Cuih Israel misenpi pawl cu Levi mi pawl vekin Abraham tesinfa an si ko naón ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat an pe thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Melkhizedek cu Levi tesinfa a si lo; asinain Abraham hnenin ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a lak ih Pathian thutiamnak a cotu Abraham cu thlawsuah a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlawsuah a petu cu thlawsuah pekmi a cotu hnakin a tum deuh ti cu a fiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi tesinfa puithiam a si mi thu-ah cun, ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat cu a thi leh dingmi minung in an lak; sikhalsehla Melkhizedek thu-ah cun, Ca Thianghlim ih a ti vekin, ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat cu a nungmi in a co a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Abraham in ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a pek tikah (Levi tesinfa pawl khal ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a petu an si ih) Levi khal in a pek ve ti theih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Levi cu a suak hrih lo naón amah a hringtu Abraham kha Melkhizedek in a ton tikah Abraham ih pum sungah a rak um zo, ti a theih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi mi puithiam phun an sinak sirhsan in Daan cu Israel mi hnenah pek a si. Cule Levi mi pawl in puithiam hna an ṭuannak a famkimmi rak sisehla puithiam phun dang, puithiam Aaron hrin si loin puithiam Melkhizedek phun a suah a ṭul lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam sinak a thleng awk tikah daan khal a thleng awk a ṭul ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi thu hmuahhmuah in a sawh duhmi cu kan Bawipa cu a hrin a dang ih a phunpi sungin zohman biakṭheng ah puithiam a ṭuantu an um dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah cu Judah hrin sung ihsin a suakmi a si ti cu mi hmuahhmuah ih theih a si; cule Moses in puithiam thuhla a sim tikah hi Judah phun thu cu a telh dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi thu cu thufiang sinsin a si; Melkhizedek bangtuk puithiam phun dang pakhat a suak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah cu milai ih tuahmi nunphung le daan in puithiam cangmi a si lo; cemti nei lo nunnak ih huham thawngin a cangmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim in, “Nang cu Melkhizedek puithiam si daan vekin kumkhua puithiam na si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah daan hlun cu san a tlai lo ih a ṭhathnem nawn lo ruangah an hnong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ziangahtile Moses Daan in zianghman famkim in a tuah theimi a um lo; cule atu-ah cun Pathian kan naih theinak dingah a ṭha deuhmi ruahsannak in pek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Pathian ih tiamkamnak a um hrih fawn. Midang puithiam an rak si laiah cubangtuk tiamkamnak cu a um dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cu tiamkamnak thawn puithiam a cang ih a hnenah Pathian in, “Bawipa in thukamnak fek zetin a tuah ih a thu cu a ṭhin lo ding; ‘Nangmah cu kumkhua-in puithiam na si ding,’,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi bangtuk ih an dan awknak in Jesuh cu a ṭha deuhmi thukamnak ih aamahkhan ah a cangter fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule an dan awknak phun khat a um lala: cumi cu ziang a si tile, puithiam dang cu tampi an um ih an thih ruangah an hnaṭuan an peh thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jesuh cu kumkhua in a nung ih kumkhua in puithiam a si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah atu le kumkhua in amah ih sungin Pathian a pantu pawl cu a rundam thei a si; ziangahtile kumkhua ih a nun ruangah Pathian hnenah a dil sak ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah Jesuh cu kan ṭulmi a kimter theitu Puithiam Sang a si. Amah cu a thianghlimmi a si; sualnak le mawhnak a nei lo; misual pawl hnen ihsin a hrante in ṭhen a si ih van tlunah cawisang a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih cu puithiam dang bangtuk a si lo; puithiam dang bangtuk in nitin amah ih hrangah hmaisabik ah sualthlah thawinak pek ih cuih hnuah misenpi hrangih thawinak pek ti a ṭul lo. Amah ih nunnak kha a pek tikah kumkhua daih in raithawinak voikhat lawng a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses Daan in mi famkim lo pawl kha Puithiam Sangah a tuah. Sikhalsehla Moses daan hnu ih a rami tiamkamnak thawn tuahmi Pathian thukamnak in kumkhua in a famkimih tuahmi a Fapa kha Puithiam Sangah a hril a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan simmi ih a sawh duh bikmi cu: vancung Pathian tokham sunglawi vorhlam rori ah a to theitu Puithiam Saang kan nei, timi hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim bikah Puithiam Saang cu a ṭuan ih cuih hmun cu minung ih sakmi puanthlam si loin Bawipa ih sakmi puanthlam ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam hmuahhmuah ih hnaṭuan cu Pathian hnenih pekmi laksawng le thawinakih pekmi ṭilva ap ding kha a si; cubangtuk in kan Puithiam Saang khal in ziangtal pek ding a neih ve a ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung parah um sehla puithiam a ṭuan lo ding, ziangahtile Judah daanin laksawng pekmi a aptu dingah puithiam dang an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuti leilungih puithiam an ṭuanmi cu vancungih puithiam ṭuannak ih a thluathlam lawng a si. Cuvek thothoin Moses ih thuhla khalah a si. Moses in thukamnak puanthlam a sak zik tikah Pathian in a hnenah, “Tlang parih zohṭhim ding ka lo hmuhmi vek cekci in nan sak pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih ṭuanmi hnakin a ṭha deuhmi puithiam hnaṭuannak cu Jesuh hnenah pek a si zo. Pathian le a minung karlakih Jesuh in a tuahmi thukamnak cu a ṭha deuhmi kamawknak a si bangtuk in a puithiam hnaṭuannak khal cu a ṭha deuhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmaisa thukamnak ah famkim lonak um hlah sehla a neta deuh ih thukamnak cu a ṭul lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in a minung pawl a mawhthluk ih, “Bawipa in hiti in a sim: Israel mi le Judah mi pawl thawn thukamnak a thar in ka tuah ding caan a ra thleng cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an pipu pawl an kutin ka hruai ih Izipt ram ihsin, ka suah laiih ka tuahmi thukamnak bangtuk cu a si lo ding. An hnenih ka rak tuahmi thukam cu an thlun duh lo ruangah kei khal in zianghman ah ka siar hai lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in: “A ra dingmi tikcu caanah Israel mi pawl thawn hi bangtuk in thukamnak ka tuah ding; Ka daan cu an ruahnak parah ka ret ding ih, an thinlung sungah ka ngan ding. Keimah hi an Pathian ka si dingih annih cu ka minung an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zohman in an unau siseh an ramsungih an phunpi siseh, ‘Bawipa thei uh,’ an ti awk a ṭul nawn lo ding. Ziangahtile upa bik in nauta bik tiang an zatein in thei ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An sualnak ka ngaidam ding ih, an mawhnak khal ka ciing nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bangtuk in thukam thar thu Pathian in a sim ruangah a thukamnak a hmaisa cu a hlun ah a cang zo; cule a hlun zomi le a ṭet zomi pawl cu a rei hlanah an hloral ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmaisa bik Thukamnak in Pathian biak daan a nei ih milai ih tuahmi biakkhawmnak hmun khal a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakinn cu puan in an sak ih a lenglam khaan cu Hmun Thianghlim an ti. Cutawkah mei-inn le cabuai le Pathian hnenih pekmi saang pawl an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puanzar pahnihnak ih dunglamah Hmun Thianghlim Bik timi khaan a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutawkah rimhmui urnak sui biakṭheng le sui ih khutmi Thukam Kuang tla an um. Cuih Thukam Kuang sungah manna saang an retnak sui beel le hnah-no a cerhmi Aaron ih kianghrol le thukham pawl an ngannak lungtlep pahnih khal an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih Thukam Kuang parah cun Pathian sunlawinak langtertu Cherub timi thlanei zuk an ret ih sual ngaithiamnak hmun tlunah an thla an pharh aw. Atu cu hi vek thu famkimih simnak tikcu a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih thil an tuah daan cu hiti in a si. Puithiam pawl cu an hnaṭuan ṭuan dingah nitinte a lenglam deuh khaan sungah an lut ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puithiam Saang lawnglawng a sungta khaan sungah kum khat voikhat a lut. Amah ih sualnak le mi dang in thei loin sualnak an tuah pangmi sualnak hrangah thisen a keng ih Pathian a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi bangtuk an tuahmi sungin Thlarau Thianghlim in fiang zetih a langter mi cu: puanthlam lengta deuh a um lai ahcun Hmun Thianghlim Bik fehnak lamzin a ong hrih lo, tican a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himi cu tahṭhimnak a si ih atu kan san hi a sawh duhmi a si. A tican cu, Pathian hnenih pekmi laksawng le raithawinak ṭilva pawl in Pathian a biatu pawl ih thinlung famkim in a tlengfai thei lo, tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile cuih raithawinak pawl cu rawl le tidai le thianfainak ih tuahmi thawinak thawn a pehtlai awmi an si. Cu pawl cu a lenglam daan lawnglawng an si ih Pathian in ziang hmuahhmuah a thar in a rem hlan sung lawngih hmanmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Khrih cu thil ṭha a um ciami pawl ih tlunah Puithiam Saang si dingin a ra zo a si. A hnaṭuannak puanthlam cu a tum sawn ih a famkim fawn. Milai ih tuahmi puanthlam a si lo ih hi leilung tuahmi thil sungih a telmi khal a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khrih cu cuih puanthlam sungah a lut ih Hmun Thianghlim Bik ah kumkhua daihin a thlen tikah me thisen le cawcang thisen pawl kha raithawinak hrangah a keng lo; amah ih thisen sawn a keng ih kan hrangah kumkhua rundamnak a tuahsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thiang lo misenpi parah puithiam in me thisen le cawcang thisen le urmi cawla ih vutcam pawl kha a theh ih cumi cun biaknak lamih an thianfai lonak hmuahhmuah a thianfaiter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cubangtuk in thianfainak a um thei a si ahcun ziang tlukin so Khrih ih thisen cun a thianfaiter sinsin ding! Kumkhua ih a nungmi Thlarau sungin a famkimmi raithawinak ah amah le amah Pathian hnenah a pe aw a si. A nungmi Pathian hna kan ṭuan theinak dingah, santlai lo daan thlunnak ihsin kan siaṭha thleidannak thinlung kha a thisen in a tlengfai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah Pathian ih a kawhmi pawl in Pathian ih a kam ciami kumkhua thlawsuah an co theinak dingah thukam thar a ngaihtuahtu cu Khrih a si. Cumi a si theinak cu Khrih a thihnak thawngin a si. A thihnak in a hmaisa thukamnak thuai an um laiih an sualnak sung ihsin a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ro cah thu kan ti ahcun ro cahtu a thih hnu lawngih thlun ding a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ziangahtile a nun lai ahcun a ro cahmi cu hman a theih lo; a thih hnu lawngah hman a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah a si thukamnak hmaisa deuh hrang hmanah thisen thawn lawngin sullam a neihnak cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in a hmaisabik ah Daan cabu sungih a ummi thukam hmuahhmuah cu misenpi hnenah a than. Cuih hnuah cawcang thisen le me thisen kha a lak ih tidai thawn a rawi hnuah, hissop thinghnge fate le tuuhmul sen ṭemcihmi hmangin, Daan cabu le misenpi kha a theh hai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nan thlun dingah Pathian ih thukamnak a lo pekmi a hngettertu cu hi thisen hi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in Moses in thisen cu Thukam Puanthlam le Pathian biaknak ih an hmanmi thilri pawlah a theh ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Daan sungih a um vekin ziang hmuahhmuah cu thisen lawngin a tlengfai ih thisen a luan lonak ahcun sualngaidamnak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vancung ih a ummi thil an cawncopmi pawl cu cubangtuk ih thianfaiter an ṭul. Asinain vancungih ummi a ngaingai a si mi khal in thawinak ṭha sinsin a ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih a ngaingai an cawncopmi thil, milai ih tuahmi Hmun Thianghlim sungah Khrih cu a lut lo. A luhnak cu vancung a si ih atu-ah kan ai-awh in Pathian hmaika ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah mi Puithiam Saang cu kumtinte ṭilva thisen keng tahratin Hmun Thianghlim Bik sungah a lut. Sikhalsehla Khrih cu amah le amah raithawinak ih pe-aw dingin voi tampi a lut lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />cuti si lo sehla leilung seemtir ihsi cun voi tamzet a tuar a ṭul ding. Cubangtuk si loin atu san neta bik a cem zawng ah hin, amah le amah raithawinak ah pe-aw in sualnak a tlengfai theinak dingah kumkhua daih in voikhat lawng a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Minung cu zokhal voikhat thih keel a si; cuih hnuah Pathian in thu a ṭhen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Khrih khal minung sualnak tlengfai dingah raithawinak hrangah voikhat a pe-aw. Cule voihnihnak a lang sal dingih cutik ahcun sualnak thu-ah si nawn loin amah a hngaktu pawl rundam dingah a si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah mi pawl ih Daan cun a ngaingai a si mi kha felte le kimtein a langter thei lo; a ra thleng dingmi thil ṭha ih thluathlam lawng a si. An tuah ṭheumi raithawinak kha kumtinte an tuah ringring. Cutiin asile ziangtinso Daan ih a fialmi hi bangtuk raithawinak pawl hmangin Pathian a pantu minung pawl cu mi famkimah a tuah thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian a biatu pawl an sualnak ihsin thianfaitermi rak si ngaingai hai sehla an sual phuhrunawknak an nei nawn lo ding ih raithawinak hmuahhmuah a um nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thil umdaan ngaingai ahcun kumtinte an sualnak an theihnak dingah raithawinak cu a rak si riangri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangahtile cawcang thisen le me thisen in sualnak cu a tlengfai thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cubangtuk a si ruangah leilungih Khrih a rung lang zik tikah Pathian hnenah, “Raithawinak le peknak cu na duhmi an si lo; sikhalsehla ka hrangah taksapum na remruat zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭilva pum ih pekmi mei-ur thawinak parah lungkimnak na nei lo. Sual thianfainak dingih raithawinak khalah lungawinak na nei cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Daan cabu sungih ka thuhla an nganmi vekin a hnenah, ‘Maw Pathian, na duhmi tuah dingin hinah ka um,’ ka ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmaisa bikih a simmi cu, “Raithawinak le hlanmi ah siseh, biakṭheng parih ṭilva le sual thianfainak hrangih raithawinak ah siseh, na lungawi zawng le na duhmi khal an si lo,” a ti. Hi raithawinak pawl cu Daan vekih tuahmi an si ṭheh ko naón hi bangtuk in a sim thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih hnuah anih in, “Maw Pathian, na duhmi tuah dingah hinah ka um,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Pathian in raithawinak hlun pawl cu a hnong thluh ih cuih ai-ah Khrih raithawinak a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian in tuahter a duhmi cu Jesuh Khrih in a tuah ṭheh ruangah amah ih taksapum kumkhua daih in a pek awknak thawngin kan sualnak ihsin in tlengfai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah puithiam pawl in an ṭuanvo cu nitinte an tuah ih an pek ṭheumi raithawinak cu voi tampi an pek. Sikhalsehla raithawinak in sualnak cu a tlengfai dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Khrih in sualnak hrangah raithawinak cu voikhat a pek ih cucu kumkhua daih a si; cuih hnuah Pathian vorhlam kamah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin Pathian in a ral pawl a ke-phah ih a tuah hai hlan sung a hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Voikhat raithawinak in sualnak ihsin a tlengfaimi pawl cu kumkhua mi famkimah a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Thlarau Thianghlim khal in a theihpinak kan hnenah a langter. A hmaisabik ah Thlarau Thianghlim in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Himi hi Bawipa ih ṭongkam a si: Hmailam caanah anmah thawn kan tuah dingmi thukam cu hiti in a si; Ka daan pawl an thinlung sungah ka re ding ih an ruahnak parah ka ngan ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih tlunah a sim sal ih, “An sualnak le an siatnak pawl cu ka ciing nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cubangtuk in an sualnak ngaidam a si ahcun sualthawinak a ṭul nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah u le nau pawl, Jesuh thihnak thawngin Hmun Thianghlim Bik sungih luh theinak luatnak famkim kan nei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah in puanzar thlek tahratin lamzin thar, lamzin nung, in on sak zo. Cuih puanzar cu amah ih taksa pum kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vancung ih Pathian innpi kilkhawitu dingah Puithiam Saang bik kan nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah thinlung tak ngai le zumnak fel thawn Pathian cu naih uhsi. Mawhnak thinlung thianfaitermi le tidai thiang thawn tlengfaimi kan taksapum thawn Pathian cu pan uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruahsannak kan nei tiih kan langtermi kha hngetkhoh zetin pom uhsi; ziangahtile a thukamnak a kimtertu Pathian cu rintlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat zawnruahnak nei uhsi; pakhat le pakhat bawm aw in duhdawtnak le ṭhatnak khal langter ton uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmunkhatih kan pumkhawm ṭheumi kha baansan hlah uhsi. Mihrek cun an baansan naón Bawipa ih Ni a nai vivo ruangah, kannih cu pakhat le pakhat thazaang pe-aw sinsin ding kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thudik kan theih ngah hnuah sualnak kha thei cingin kan tuah vivo thotho a si ahcun sual thianfai theinak dingah sual hrang raithawinak zianghman a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hrangih a taangmi an covo cu a thleng cing dingmi Pathian thuṭhennak le Pathian a dodaltu pawl a kaangfai ṭhehtu ding ṭihnungza meisa kha ṭih thlohthlo in an hngak ding lawng a si thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses Daan thu a thlun lotu cu thutheitu pahnih pathum in a sual a si an tinak in a thu an relcatmi cu, zaangfahnak zianghman um loin thah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuti asile, Pathian Fapa ziangih a siar lotu le sualnak ihsin mi a thianfaitertu Pathian thukamnak thisen nautattu le, zaangfahnak a neitu Thlarau a hmuhsuamtu pawl teh ziang bangtuk in tuah an si pei? Cubangtuk minung cu ziangtlukih a nasami hremnak an tuar ding tikha ruat hnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ziangahtile, “Keimah in phu ka la ding, keimah in ka lehrul ding,” a tiih tlunah, “Bawipa in a minung pawl cu an thu a ṭhen ding,” a titu zo a si ti kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nungmi Pathian kut sungih tlak cu tuksumza a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hlanih nan um daan vun ruathnik uh. Culai ah Pathian tleunak nan hnenih a thlen pek ah khan tuarnak le harsatnak a phunphun nan tong naón cuih harsatnak in a lo neh hai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Voikhat khatah misenpi hmuhah hmuhsuamnak le hremnak nan tong ih voi dangah cuti vekih hmuhsuamnak le hremnak a tongtu pawl nan tuarpi ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Harsatnak a tongmi thawngtla pawl parah lainatnak nan nei. Nan neihmi thilri hmuahhmuah an lo lon ṭheh tikah nan sunnak cu lungawiin nan tuar thei, ziangahtile hi thilri hnakin a ṭha deuhmi le kumkhua in a hmun dingmi kan nei hrih a si, ti nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Curuangah nan thin nau hlah uh, ziangahtile ralṭhatnak nan neih ahcun laksawng tumpi nan ngah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian duhnak tuah thei dingah le a thukammi co thei dingah thinfual in um uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ziangahtile Ca Thianghlim in, “Caan tawite hnuah a ra dingmi Amah cu a thleng ding, a rei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A dingmi ka miphun in an zum ding ih an nung ding; Asinain dungsiptu an um ahcun, an parah ka lung a awi lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kannih cu dungah a siip ih a hloral tami kan si lo. Rinnak nei in rundamnak a cotu sawn kan si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zumnak neih timi cu kan ruahsanmi kan ngah tengteng ding, ti zum le kan mit ih kan hmuh thei lomi a um rori a si, ti zum khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cubangtuk zumnak an neih ruangah khuahlan minung pawl in Pathian ih lungkimnak an co ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zumnak kan neih ruangah leikhawvel le vantlolak hi Pathian ih ṭong in a tuah a si ti kan thei; curuangah Pathian in hmuh theimi tuahnak ah hmuh thei lomi a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abel in Pathian a zum ruangah Pathian hnenih a pekmi raithawinak cu Kain ih raithawinak hnakin a ṭha deuhmi a si. A zumnak ruangah Pathian lunghmuinak a co ih miding ah cosaan a si, ziangahtile a laksawng pawl cu Pathian in a co sak. Abel cu a thi zo naón a zumnak sungin mi hnenah thu a sim lai rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Enok kha thi loin Pathian hnenih cawiso a sinak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. Zohman in a ruangpi an hmu lo, ziangahtile Pathian in a cawi hlo a si. Ca Thianghlim sungah, “Pathian hnenih cawi hlo a si hlanah Enok in Pathian lung a awiter,” tiin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zumnak locun zohman in Pathian lungawiter a theih lo; ziangahtile Pathian a pantu in Pathian a um, ti le amah a hawltu hnenah hawlman laksawng a pe, ti an zum a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noah kha hmailam thu-ah Pathian in ralrinnak a pekmi a theih theinak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. Pathian thu a ngai ih lawng a tuah ih cuih lawng sungah amah le a innsang himte in an luat. Curuangah leilung cu hnonnak a tong ih Noah cu a zumnak ruangah dingnak Pathian hnen ihsin a co.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham cu Pathian in ka lo pe ding tiih a tiammi ram feh dingih kawh a si tikah Pathian duhnak a thlun theinak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. Khuitawk ramah ka feh ding ti hman thei loin a khua le a ram cu a fehsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in a tiam ciami ram sungah a zumnak in mikhual cangin a um. Pathian thutiamnak a co vemi Isaak le Jakob vekin thlam sungah a um ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian in kumkhua hmun dingih hram a bunmi, ruang a zingmi le a sakmi khawpi sung um dingah a hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham cu a tarzet zo ih Sarah khal fa nei thei nawn lo a si naón, pa ih can theinak cah-nak cu a zumnak thawngin a si. Pathian in a thutiamnak cu a tuahsuak ko ding tiin a zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham cu a thi cia zo tlukih ruahmi a si naón amah sung ihsin tesinfa vanih arsi zat le tipikap ih siarcawk lo vunnel zat in an suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tlunih kan simmi zumnak neitu pawl cu an thih tikah zumnak thawn an thi. Pathian ih a tiam ciami pawl cu an co ngah lo naón a hlavaang ihsin an hmu ih an lung a awi thotho; leilung tlunah mikhual le mi vakvai an si kha langhngan in an phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cubangtuk ih a thei awtu pawl cun an ta a si dingmi an ram an hawl ti a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An fehsanmi ram cu an seherh nawn lo; rak seherh hai sehla kirnak tikcu an nei ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Annih ih an ruahmi le an ngaimi cu ram ṭha deuh sawn, vancung ram a si. Curuangah Pathian cu annih in, “Kan Pathian,” tiih an kawh tikah Pathian a ning a zak lo, ziangahtile an hrangah khawpi a tuah sak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abraham cu Pathian in a hniksak tikah Pathian hnenah a fapa Isaak kha raithawinak ah a pek theinak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. Pathian in thu a tiammi cu Abraham a si, sikhalsehla a fapa neihsun cu raithawinak ih pe dingah a ralring cia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham hnenah, “Ka lo tiam ciami tesinfa pawl cu Isaak ih cithlahmi an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham ih ruahnak ahcun Pathian in Isaak cu thihnak ihsin a thoter sal ding tiin a ruat ih a ruah vekin a thi zo tlukih ruahmi Isaak cu a pa Abraham in a nungin a tong sal ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaak in hmailamah thlawsuahnak nan ngah ding tiah Jakob le Esau thlua a suahnak cu a zumnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob in a thih hlan deuhte-ah Josef fapa pawl kha thlawsuah a pek fingfingnak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. A kianghrol hngauhsan phahin Pathian a bia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef cu a thih zik hmanah Israel mi pawl Izipt ram ihsin an suak leh ding tiah a simnak le a thih tikah a ruak kha ziangti ih tuah ding tiin thu a cahta ṭhehnak cu a zumnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses nu le pa in Moses a suah hnu thla thum sung an faate cu an thup ih duhnungza a si ruangah Siangpahrang ih thupekmi el hman an ṭih lonak cu an zumnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses cu a hung upat hnuah Izipt siangpahrang fanu ih fapa tiih kawh a duh lonak cu a zumnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Caan tawite sung sualnak sungah nunnuamih um hnakin Pathian minung pawl thawn harsatnak tuar a hril sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Messiah hrangih nautatnak tuar cu Izipt ram sungih lennak hmuahhmuah hnakin a man sawn tiin a ruat; ziangahtile a hmuitin mi cu hmailamih ngah dingmi tuarman laksawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moses cu Izipt ram siangpahrang thinhengnak hman ṭih loin Izipt ram a tlansan ngamnak cu a zumnak ruangah a si. Hmuh a theih lomi Pathian hmu vekin a zum ih a kir duh hrimhrim nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zumnak a neih ruangah lantak puai kha a tuah ih sangka parah thisen theh dingin thu a pek. Cubangtuk a tuahnak cu Israel mi fatir pawl kha Mithattu Vancungmi in that hai hlahseh tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zumnak thawngin Israel mi pawl in Tipi Sen cu leiro vekin an tan thei; asinain Izipt mi pawl in tan an tum ve tikah tidai in a khuh hai ih an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in ni sarih sung an vel hnuah Jerikho khawpi kulhnak phar a cim ṭhehtertu cu zumnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mi thlingthlatu pawl a humthup ruangah Pathian thu ngai lo Jerikho khuami pawl lakah hlawhhlangnu Rahab a thih ve lonak cu a zumnak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka sim vivo hrih ding maw? Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jefthah, David, Samuel le profet pawl ih thuhla sim ding tampi an um naón simnak tikcu caan a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zumnak thawn ram tampi an do ih an neh. A dikmi an tuah ih Pathian thutiammi an co. Kiosa pawl ih kaa an ciipter;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ṭihnungza meisa an mit ih ralnam thahnak ihsin an luat. Mi ṭawnṭai an rak si naón mi cakzet ah an cang. Raldo ah an cak ih ramdang ralkap tampi an neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zumnak thawngin nunau pawl ih sungkhat pawl thihnak ihsin nunter saal an si. Midang pawl cu nunnak ṭha sawnih thawhter sal ding an duh ruangah luatnak hril loin hremnak sungih thih an hril sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi hrek cu hmuhsuam le vuak an tong; mi hrek cu thir cikcin in an khit ih thawngah an thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lungto in denthat an si, hluah in tan hnih ih tan an tuar ih ralnam in thahnak an tong; tuuphaw le mephaw hruk tahratin hmun kipah an vakvai; an farah ih hremnak le tisiatnak an tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An hrangah leilung tlun hi umnak ṭha a si nawn lo! Raltlanmi bangin hramlak le tlang lakah an vakvai ih lungpuk le leilung kua sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zumnak an neih ruangah himi pawl hmuahhmuah hi ziangtluk porh tlak so an si! Asinain Pathian ih a tiam ciami pawl an ngah hrih lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />ziangahtile Pathian in kan hrangah khawkhanmi ṭha deuh a neih ruangah a si. A tumtah ngaingaimi cu kanmah thawn kan hmunkhat hnu lawngah famkimnak an ngah ding tihi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kannih khal hitlukin a tammi thutheitu pawl in mero bangin in kiil ruangah kan fehnak lamzinah in dawnkhamtu thil pawl kha hlonin in ṭawnhremtu kan sualnak thilrit cu tlansan tahratin kan hmaiih a ummi tlanzuamnak ah taimak suah in tlan uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan zumnak a thoktu le a famkimtertu Jesuh kha cat loin zoh uhsi. Hmailamih a co dingmi lungawinak kha a tumtahmi a si ruangah thinglamtah parih ningzah thihnak hman ziangah siar loin a tuar ih atu-ah cun Pathian tokham vorhlam kapah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuarmi pawl ruathnik uh! Misual pawl ih huatnak a zawi thei zia kha! Curuangah nannih khal thinnau le beidong in um pang hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangahtile sualnak nan donak ah hin thihnak tiang ngaingai cun nan ṭang hrih lo sokhaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in a faate pawl nan hnenah thapeknak thu a lo simmi kha nan hngilh zo maw si? “Ka fapa, Bawipa in nun a lo sim tikah ziang siar loin um hlah aw. A lo kawk tikah na tha nau hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa in a duhdawtmi cu nun a sim ih, fa ih a cohlanmi cu a hrem ṭheu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Harsatnak cu nan pa ih pekmi nunsimnak a si tiin tuar hram uh; ziangahtile harsatnak nan tonmi hin Pathian in a faate ah a lo ruat a si ti a langter. A pa ih nun a sim lomi fa a um dah keel maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A faate pawl a hrem ih nannih bul a lo hrem lo ahcun faate ngaingai nan si lo, fasawn nan si ti a sawh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leilung tlunih kan pale pawl ruathnik uh; in hrem naón kannih in kan upat. Nunnak kan ngah theinak dingah Thlarau lam kan Pa ih thu cu ziangtluk in so thlun sinsin ding kan si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan pale pawl cun a ṭha tiin an ruat ruangah caan tawite sung in hrem; sikhalsehla Pathian cun kanmah ih ṭhatnak hrangah le amah ih thianhlimnak kan ṭawm theinak dingah in hrem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hremnak kan tuar tikah kan tuar laiah cun kan lung in awitertu si loin kan riah in siattertu a si. Sikhalsehla a hnuah cun cubangtuk hremnak in nunsimnak a tongtu pawl cu an nunnak ah daihnak le dingnak laksawng an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kham zetmi nan kut thlir uhla a ṭhiami nan khuk khohter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A dingmi lamzin zawh vivo uhla cuticun nan ke-awl kha awl lanta loin a dam ṭheh sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah thawn rualremte in um zuam uhla nunnak thiangin nun tum uh, ziangahtile nunnak thiang neih locun zohman in Pathian an hmu thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian lainatnak kha zohman in siipsan lo dingin ralring uh. A sia a khami thingkung, a hung tum ih a tur ṭha loin mi tampi zonzaihnak a pek bangtuk cu zohman si hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nu le pa sualnak tuah hlah uh; thlarau lam zianghman a siar lotu Esau bangtuk si hlah uh; anih cun fa upa rocotu sinak kha rawl voikhat ei-ah a zuar hlo meen a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan theih vekin neh hnuah a pa ih hnen ihsin thlawsuahnak ngah sal a duh naón a ngah thei nawn lo a si kha! Ziangahtile mitthli thawn ngen rero hmansehla a tuah ciami cu a ṭhin thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nannih nan thlennak tlang cu Israel mi pawl an thlennak Sinai tlang bangtuk a si lo. Sinai tlang cu tham theimi, mei a alh hluahhlomi le khuadur thimnak le thlisia le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tawtawrawt tummi le a ringzetmi aw kha hmuh thei le theih thei in a um a si. Israel mi pawl in aw an theih tikah cuih aw cu thei nawn lo dingin an dil,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ziangahtile Pathian ih thupekmi, “Tlang a daitu cu, ramsa a si khalle, lungto in denthat a si ding,” timi aw kha an ngai ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hmuhmi cu ṭihnung rapthlakza a si ruangah Moses hman in, “Ka ṭih tuk ih ka khur thlohthlo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nannih nan thlennak tlang cu Zion Tlang le a nungmi Pathian ih khawpi, vancungmi a thawng thawngin an umnak vancung Jerusalem a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vancung ah an hmin ngan cia in a ummi Pathian ih fatir pawl lungawi aipuang ih an pumkhawmnak nan thleng zo a si. Mi hmuahhmuah thuṭhentu Pathian le famkimter zomi miding pawl ih thlarau hnenah nan thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thukam thar tuahtu palai Jesuh, Abel thisen hnakih ṭha sawn in thu a simtu, Jesuh ih thehmi thisen ah nan thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah nan hnenih thu a simtu ih thu el lo dingin ralring uh. Pathian thuthang leilung tlunih an simmi hman a eltu cu an luat lo. Vancung ihsin a simtu ih thu sinsin tla cu kan ngai lo le ziangtlukin so kan luat lo sinsin ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Culai ahcun a aw in leilung a hnin ṭheh; atu-ah cun, “Lei lung lawng si loin vancung tiangin ka hnin ṭheh sal ding,” tiah thu in tiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka hnin ṭheh sal ding,” timi ṭong in leilungih siammi thil hmuahhmuah hi hnin ṭheh le thawn ṭheh an si ding ih hnin a theih lomi cu a taang ding, tinak a langter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah lungawi aipuang in um uhsi. Ziangahtile hnin a theih lomi uknak kan co a si. Pathian hnenah kan lungawinak langter uhsila a lungawi zawng in Amah cu upatnak le ṭihzahnak thawn bia uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ziangahtile kan Pathian cu mi a kaangral theitu meisa a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khristian unau nan si bangtuk in pakhat le pakhat duhdaw aw ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan innah mikhual tlunter uhla duhdaw uh. Cubangtuk a tuahtu pawl cu an theih loin an innah vancungmi an tlungter ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thawngtlami hngilh hlah uh; anmah thawn thawng a tla tlaang bangtuk in ruat aw uh. Harsatnak a tuartu pawl hngilh hlah uh; anmah thawn a tuar tlaang bangtuk in ruat aw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭhitawknak cu zokhal in upat hmaizah ding a si. Nupi le pasal cu zumtlak in um veve hai seh. Nupa sualnak a tuahtu le ṭang ṭawm sualnak a tuahtu pawl cu thu ṭhennak an tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangka duh tuk hlah uh; nan neihmi-ah nan lung kim uh. Ziangahtile Pathian in, “Ka lo tlansan lo ding ih ka lo hnong lo ding,” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah ralṭha in um uhsila, “Bawipa cu i bawmtu a si, ka thin a phang lo ding. Mi in ziangso ka parah an tuah thei ding?” tiah ti uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian thu a lo simtu, hlanih nan hotu pawl kha ciing ringring uh. An nun sungih an umtlandan le an thihnak thuhla pawl kha ruat saal uhla an zumnak khal cawng ṭha uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesuh Khrih cu mizan, tuihsun le kumkhua in a hmun ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zirhnak phun dangdang in lamzin dik ihsin lo pialter hlah hai seh. Kan thinlung thazaang cahnak cu, rawl thuhla ah ei ding, ei lo ding tiih daan sung ihsin ngah loin, Pathian zaangfahnak sung ihsin ngah a ṭha sawn. Daan a thluntu pawl cu cuih an thlunmi daan in a bawm cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah mi pawl Pathian an biaknak ih hna a ṭuantu puithiam pawl in kan biakṭheng parih raithawinak pekmi pawl kha an duhduh in an ei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭilva thisen cu Judah mi Puithiam Saang in sual raithawinak hrangah Hmun Thianghlim Bik sungah a luhpi; sikhalsehla cuih ṭilva ruangpum cu hnarpawn ah an ur a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah Jesuh a thih tikah mipi an sualnak ihsin a thisen thawn tlengfai dingah Jesuh cu khawpi lengah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah kannih khal hnarpawn ah feh in a tuarmi ningzahnak tuar ve uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangahtile hi leitlunah hin kumkhua a hmunmi khawpi kan nei lo; a ra lai dingmi khawpi lawng kan cuan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah kan raithawinak ai-ah thangṭhatnak cu Pathian hnenah pe ringring uhsi; cuti kan pekmi cu kan kaa in Jesuh cu kan Bawipa a si tiih kan phuannak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭhatnak tuah kha hngilh hlah uhla, nan neihmi midang thawn hlawm-awk ding tla hngilh hlah uh; ziangahtile cumi cu Pathian lungawitertu raithawinak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan hruaitu pawl thu ngai uhla an thu pekmi bangin thlun uh. An hnaṭuan daan cu Pathian hmaiah an phuan ṭheh leh ding ruangah cawl loin an lo kilkhawinak hi a si. An thu nan ngai asile lungawi aipuang in an hna an ṭuan ding; an thu nan thlun lo asile riahsiatnak thawn an ṭuan ding ih cumi cu nan hrangah zianghman ṭhathnemnak a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan hrangah thla cam ringring uh. A dikmi kha tuah kan duh ringringmi a si ruangah siaṭha thleidannak kan thinlung cu a thiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nan hnenah Pathian in in thlenter sal cing hram dingin napi in thlacam uh, tiah ka lo dil a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Raithawinak ih a nun a peknak ruangah Tuukhal Tum kan Bawipa Jesuh cu Pathian in thihnak ihsin a thoter zo; cule a thihnak sungin kumkhua thukamnak cu a hngetter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daihnak Pathian in amah ih duhmi nan tuah theinak dingah nan ṭulmi thilṭha hmuahhmuah lo pe hram seh; cule Jesuh Khrih hmangin a duhmi cu kan sungah tuah hram seh. Kumkhua in kumkhua tiang Khrih cu sunloih si ko seh! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />U le nau tla, ka cakuat hi a sau lem lo ruangah hiti in thapeknak thu ka lo simmi hi thinsau zetin rak ngai uh, tiah ka lo dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan unau Timote cu thawng sung ihsin a suak zo ti ka lo theihter duh a si. A thlen man asile nanmah tong dingih ka rat tikah ka rak hruai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nan hruaitu pawl le Pathian minung pawl an zate hnenah kan cibai buknak in rak sim sak uh. Italy ramih a ummi unau pawl khal in cibai an lo buk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian zaangfahnak cu nan zate hnenah um hram seh.
  </para>
</usx>
